        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "ISO 15118 based energy transfer control extends PWM signal over a control pilot wire according to IEC 61851-1:2017, Annex A. For this, the messaging on application layer is synchronized with the CP states defined in IEC 61851-1:2017, Annex A.",
